 "benefits": [
  {
   "page": 15,
   "category": "benefits",
   "text": "Expansive View\nStreamlined design provides an optimal view, \nwithout lifting the blind.\nExtensive Fabric Selection\nLuxurious fabrics in a curated selection of neutral colors and textures \ncomplement every design style.  \nEnhanced Privacy\nEnjoy enhanced privacy thanks to the routeless design \ncombined with tight closing fabric slats.\nSoft, Natural Light\nUnique fabric slats create a soft, even glow—unlike \nthe slats of traditional blinds. \nEasy Operation\nAdjust slats with an innovative, new tilt bar—no twisting necessary.\nLightweight fabric slats make lifting effortless.\nBenefits\nFlexible Light Control\nCreate just the right amount of light by tilting \nthe fabric slats in either direction.\nFits Extra Large Windows \nThe wider widths of Aria™ blinds make them distinctly different—and perfect \nfor dramatically large windows.",
